<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport" >
  <style>
    @font-face {
      src: url('/assets/fonts/museosans-bold.woff2') format('woff2'),
        url('/assets/fonts/museosans-bold.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
      font-family: 'Museo Sans';
      font-weight: 900;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    @font-face {
      src: url('/assets/fonts/museosans-semibold.woff2') format('woff2'),
        url('/assets/fonts/museosans-semibold.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
      font-family: 'Museo Sans';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    @font-face {
      src: url('/assets/fonts/notosans-bold.woff2') format('woff2'),
        url('/assets/fonts/notosans-bold.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    @font-face {
      src: url('/assets/fonts/notosans-bolditalic.woff2') format('woff2'),
        url('/assets/fonts/notosans-bolditalic.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    @font-face {
      src: url('/assets/fonts/notosans-italic.woff2') format('woff2'),
        url('/assets/fonts/notosans-italic.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans';
      font-weight: normal;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    @font-face {
      src: url('/assets/fonts/notosans-regular.woff2') format('woff2'),
        url('/assets/fonts/notosans-regular.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans';
      font-weight: normal;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    @font-face {
      advance-override: 11;
      ascent-override: 79%;
      descent-override: 23.7%;
      font-family: fallback-fonts;
      letter-spacing: -.2px;
      line-gap-override: normal;
      src: local(helvetica), local(arial);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      overflow-y: scroll;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    html,
    body {
      height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Noto Sans", sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    h1,
    h3 {
      font-family: "Museo Sans", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.81);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    a {
      color: #0076d6;
    }

    a:hover,
    a:active {
      color: #00274d;
    }

    a:visited {
      color: #6d6d6d;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: min(1124px, calc(100% - 32px));
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: "Museo Sans", sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background-color: #0076d6;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .button:hover,
    .button:focus {
      background-color: #0064c7;
    }

    .button:active {
      background: #0050a6;
    }

    .button:visited,
    .button:hover,
    .button:active {
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
  <title>Page not found | nine.com.au -- the new ninemsn - News, Sport, TV, Entertainment, Lifestyle | Latest Breaking
    News Headlines from Australia and the world</title>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h1>Page not found</h1>
    <h3>Oops! Sorry about that</h3>
    <p>The page you were looking for has been moved or no longer exists (404 error).</p>
    <p>If you can’t find what you’re looking for, please visit our <a href="https://ninehelp.zendesk.com/hc/en-au">help
        centre</a>.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="https://www.nine.com.au">Return to home</a></p>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
